  "id": "apple-cardamom-and-stem-ginger-granola",
  "name": "Apple, Cardamom, and Stem Ginger Granola",
  "subtitle": "A crisp oat-and-seed mix with warm spice and dried fruit.",
  "description": "Bake oats, nuts, seeds, apple, and stem ginger with maple syrup, honey, and vanilla, then finish with dried fruit for a crunchy breakfast granola.",
